 {
  "turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Hello! Welcome to Nimbus Telecom. I'm Ravi. How can I help you today? 😊",
      "tags": [
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Hi Ravi, mera plan change karna hai. Current plan bahut expensive hai and data limit khatam ho jati hai jaldi.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I can certainly help you with that. Before we proceed, could you please provide your account number for verification?",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Haan, account number hai 31667923. My name is Vivek Johnson.",
      "tags": [
        "identity_verification"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you, Mr. Johnson. I understand it's frustrating when your data runs out too quickly. Let me check the best options for you.",
      "tags": [
        "empathy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Please jaldi karo, I need a cheaper plan with more data. Address is 272 Linking Road.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I have a great plan for you. The new monthly price will be 599 rupees and the change takes effect from the 1st of next month.",
      "tags": [
        "disclosure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "The price is okay, but network issues are also there. Signal bahut weak hai mere area mein.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I can assure you there won't be any more outages in your area.",
      "tags": [
        "prohibited_promise"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "I hope so. Abhi payment pending hai, let me give you my card details: four eight zero eight four one four eight five two five three eight eight eight two.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Got it. I will now process the plan change and send a confirmation SMS to your number 96139 16392.",
      "tags": [
        "action:plan_change"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Wait, why is the SMS not coming? It's been 2 minutes. Yeh kya mazaak hai? I'm getting angry now!",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Please bear with me, the system is a bit slow. Is there anything else I can help you with? I'll ensure the plan is updated and the SMS is sent. Goodbye!",
      "tags": [
        "closure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Nahi, nothing else! Your service is pathetic. I am very dissatisfied with this experience. 😡",
      "tags": []
    }
  ]
}
